<title>JAPAN: Aikoh - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aikoh - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.64		vs	    2.60</p>
<p> Operating   loss 219 million	 vs   loss 107 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 280 million	 vs   loss 201 million</p>
